    {
      "id": "0000001e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -60,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 143,
      "text": "# Monarc\nModule tiers, and the boundaries the build enforces.\n\n[[Docs/README|Docs index]]  \u00b7  [[Docs/Architecture/Overview|Overview]]  \u00b7  [[Docs/Architecture/Decisions/README|Decisions]]  \u00b7  [[Docs/Milestones/M0-First-Light|M0]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "0000001f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 208,
      "text": "## Enforced by the build\n1. Downward only, no cycles\n2. `Runtime` never depends on `Tool`/`Editor`\n3. Tier 2 never includes Tier 1 or Tier 3\n4. Headless binary: no graphics symbols\n5. Platform `#ifdef`s only in `Core/Platform`",
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
